{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "291636b1-3194-8b3c-82ec-425d38039dd1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:08:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good morning! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:06:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Jorge Correia. I want to buy a memorial bench. For one of the beach parks. Who do I talk to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, we get those requests. Do you have a particular park in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easton's side, if possible. Somewhere with a view of the water. Not sure what's available."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So there's a bench program through our office. You'd fill out an application, choose a location, and the department confirms whether that spot can take a bench. I can mail or email you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is fine. Hold on, somebody's at the door. [pause] Sorry. Neighbor locked out. I'm getting a key cut for him, so I'm in and out today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Nothing worse than being locked out in December."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Okay, I'm back. Is there a web page with same information? Might be easier than waiting on mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There should be. If you go to the city website and look under Recreation, there's a section for parks and beaches, and the bench information is usually with that. If you can't find it, call me back and I'll walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll look there. Still want the form mailed, though. Just in case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Can I get a mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd rather not give it on this call. I'll just pick it up from the web page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Then it's all there online, and the form will tell you where to send it back. Do you want to leave a phone number in case you have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five. Anything else I can help with today, Mr. Correia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome! Have a great day."
    }
  ],
